'''Under Arrest''' (タイホしちゃうぞ☆, ''Taiho Shichauzo ☆'', '''I'm Going to Arrest You ☆''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Slow" Effect UP (Sm): Slow duration increases by 10%.

